<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>2025-05 on</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/tags/2025-05/</link><description>Recent content in 2025-05 on</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 20 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://younsoid.github.io/tags/2025-05/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>초여름 부산</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/travel/daily11/</link><pubDate>Tue, 20 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/travel/daily11/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="초여름-부산"&gt;&#10; 초여름 부산&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ec%b4%88%ec%97%ac%eb%a6%84-%eb%b6%80%ec%82%b0"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2025-05-20&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/93fca964-3a49-4583-95d6-06fcd2b8b647" alt="image" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;간단하게 일상으로만 쓸려다가,,, 넘좋앗어서 그냥 따로 뺐다 ㅎㅎㅎ&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/45c2787d-5287-404c-891c-af902157f1ca" alt="image" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;다대포 할매집!! 문어삼합 / 냄비라면 / 올빚베리막걸리 시켯는데 다맛있었당 특히 딸기막걸리는 집에오니깐 또생각나서 사올걸 후회해따&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f7e6983f-1159-4010-85ce-c7bb7bfc14e4" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;인스타감성사진 찍고싶었는데 넘나 천막배경이었던것..&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/be04631d-dc3c-44e7-91f5-8fd9bf103064" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1170" height="2080" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/73ead54c-089e-44a1-aa40-3ba155fb3b83" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;넘이뻤던바닷가&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/34f3bc01-73dd-4ee7-8b7b-8bc1aaa42b6b" alt="image" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;길이사왓는데 넘맛있어서 막퍼먹은 케이크 ㅋㅋ 멜트인멜로우 검색해보니까 다른디저트도 다마싯을거같아서 또사먹을듯&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2fe0ff7b-b118-4c72-b6d8-e19c9f6574db" alt="image" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;생레몬하이볼 첨먹어봣는데 주점에서파는하이볼 같음&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a3ef2bcb-a475-4a73-a336-1d5dec4d5da3" alt="image" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;다음날&amp;hellip; 지수집엔 마싯는게 많다 일리커피가 네스프레소보다 훨배 맛있는거같음 다크원두인데 쓴맛이없고 향이 엄청 좋다&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>허허</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/previous/2024/daily4/</link><pubDate>Wed, 07 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/previous/2024/daily4/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="허허"&gt;&#10; 허허&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ed%97%88%ed%97%88"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2025. 5. 7. 16:24&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee81b691-ebdf-4f12-a76e-f7b31328031b" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ac396243-d3de-4988-9ca8-d67f0af714b4" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1260" height="1460" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee2904da-0d75-4565-b215-60605892f7ab" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;오늘비록위험할뻔한 날이었지만?? 오감자라는 완벽한 선택과 adsp공부 내던지고 고민영유튜브보기 라는 처방으로 잘 견디는중&#10;집에가서 저녁 적당히만먹구 or 베이글먹구 운동까지만하면 완벽하다구 헬스티산것도 내일오니까 더할나위없지.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;오늘상태&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;아침: 빵 2조각&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;점심: 엄마가 싸준 밥이랑 과일&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;저녁: 가벼운 저녁식사 or 베이글 1개&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;운동: 런닝머신 30분&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;완벽!!&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>열시미충전하는 연휴</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/previous/2024/daily8/</link><pubDate>Tue, 06 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/previous/2024/daily8/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="열시미충전하는-연휴"&gt;&#10; 열시미충전하는 연휴&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ec%97%b4%ec%8b%9c%eb%af%b8%ec%b6%a9%ec%a0%84%ed%95%98%eb%8a%94-%ec%97%b0%ed%9c%b4"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2025-05-06&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d444465-bdaf-4339-aa1f-ce35a2dad11e" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f75acbff-435c-44b2-8f1a-4b0352a83451" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5809f614-7f7b-45e7-bedd-6e115691c467" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/18f9db95-c363-46bb-9960-58cfafac4e14" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1c058c52-20bb-482b-9e51-93545502296e" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/93c9b425-6b92-4811-bae1-6dfb0bb084d2" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b1ac6fc1-dfdc-4189-b16c-a66032f82f18" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f48b566d-5f83-4384-9ce3-078972ed728f" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4d277fbc-2d1f-4c9b-b48c-892030f030b0" alt="image" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>